From: The Nerves Project Authors
Subject: [PATCH] dts: rk3576-recomputer-industrial: enable the SoC watchdog

The wdt node is status = "disabled" in rk3576.dtsi and nothing enables it.
Nerves arms the hardware watchdog through Erlang's heart (nerves_heart on
/dev/watchdog0 with WATCHDOG_NOWAYOUT).

The eMMC is already mmc0 (mmcblk0): rk3576-linux.dtsi aliases mmc0 = &sdhci,
which is what every Nerves path (fw_env.config, erlinit mounts, fwup
devpaths) expects.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-recomputer-industrial.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-recomputer-industrial.dts
@@ -599,3 +599,11 @@
 	clock-frequency = <32768>;
 	clock-output-names = "xin32k";
 };
+
+/*
+ * Nerves arms the SoC watchdog through Erlang's heart (nerves_heart on
+ * /dev/watchdog0 with WATCHDOG_NOWAYOUT); rk3576.dtsi leaves it disabled.
+ */
+&wdt {
+	status = "okay";
+};
